  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into the ultimate sports haven with the Custom Football Art Comforter from Jeminise. Perfect for football players, fans, and teams, this bedding set features a cool graphic illustration of football players with a large football close-up. Whether you choose the lightweight duvet cover or the cozy comforter option, this bedding adds a dynamic, athletic touch to any space, making it a thoughtful custom gift for holidays or birthdays.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features two custom text inputs to personalize your sports-themed bedding.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Two Bedding Options:</strong> Choose between a lightweight, easy-to-wash Duvet Cover with a hidden zipper closure or a thicker, cozy Comforter with warm microfiber filling.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester microfiber fabric for a soft, breathable, and durable feel.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Perfectly sized for US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each package comes with 1 Duvet Cover or Comforter, with optional matching pillowcases and flat sheet covers.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water on a gentle cycle; tumble dry on low heat for quick, fluffy drying.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Football Art</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
